WEBVTT

00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:17,520
Has anyone had any success taking oral B-17 or amygdala possibly in high doses?

00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:26,520
I should have pulled up a picture of this. We have a number of people that tested well for B-17.

00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:34,520
We use the apricot, our brand B-17. It comes in two formulas.

00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:42,520
One is a 500 milligram per capsule formula, and one is a 100 milligram per capsule formula.

00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:47,520
Now, high doses depends on how you define that.

00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:56,520
Typically, you depend on your weight, but let's say your body weight is 125 pounds.

00:00:56,520 --> 00:01:03,520
The maximum dose you'd really go is, and you'd have to work up to this dose,

00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:10,520
it would be probably three to four 500 milligram capsules per day.

00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:18,520
Now, I know there's some clinics that go much higher than that, but they typically do that for a shorter period of time.

00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:25,520
Some people don't tolerate super high doses of B-17.

00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:34,520
So, I always suggest you start slow with a lower dose to begin with, and then work up.

00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:44,520
We've had one person, and it was actually a staff person a number of years ago that took nine or ten of them at one time.

00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:51,520
I have no idea why, and they got a really bad headache, and they felt sick and had to lay down and flush them with water,

00:01:51,520 --> 00:02:02,520
and it took about three hours to pass, so they felt better, but they learned a lesson not to overdose on that.

00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:12,520
It's very powerful, and it can make you sick too, so you have to just be careful with your dosage, so you're not overdosing on that.

